## 12. Bond Prospectus Update Rule

**`frontend/project/danube/danube_basin_bond.html` must be updated every time any of the following change:**

- A new subproject is marked active (adds to the composite basin score)
- A subproject chain balance or coherence score changes (affects composite basin score)
- A new KPI is defined or an existing KPI value changes
- A new paired hub is built (adds a new KPI anchor and nav link)
- The step-up trigger maximum changes (6 KPIs × 25 bps = 150 bps maximum step-up)

**Fields that require updating when the above occur:**

| Bond page field | Source of truth |
|---|---|
| Active KPIs count (hero panel) | Count of KPI cards in KPI grid |
| Composite Basin Score (hero panel) | Average of all active subproject `pi` scores (chain balance) |
| Composite Basin Score (Uruguay comparison table) | Same average |
| Composite score collateral paragraph | Same average; also update subproject count |
| KPI grid cards | One card per active KPI; add new card for each new paired system |
| Progress bar JS `KPIS` array | Add new entry for each new KPI |
| Step-up trigger (prospectus table) | N KPIs × 25 bps = max step-up |
| KPI framework (prospectus table) | List all active KPIs |
| Use of proceeds (prospectus table) | Add new bond use for each new subproject category |
| Non-EU pre-conditions (prospectus table) | Add new pre-condition if new subproject has non-EU governance gap |
| KPI verification (prospectus table) | Add new data source for each new KPI |
| Nav links (bottom of page) | Add link for each new active paired hub |

**Composite basin score calculation:**
```
composite_score = sum(pi_score for each active subproject) / count(active subprojects)
```
Active subproject pi scores (update this list as subprojects are added):

| Subproject | pi score |
|---|---|
| natural_freshwater_availability | 88 |
| human_freshwater_supply_infrastructure | 88.6 |
| human_irrigation_infrastructure | 82 |
| natural_delta_biodiversity | 83 |
| human_cultural_heritage_management | 81 |
| natural_floodplain_forest_biomass | 81 |
| human_floodplain_forestry_operations | 76 |
| natural_fish_population | 78 |
| human_commercial_fishing | 76 |
| natural_reed_bed | 81 |
| human_reed_industry | 78 |
| natural_river_channel | 79 |
| human_commercial_navigation | 79 |

Current composite: (88+88.6+82+83+81+81+76+78+76+81+78+79+79) / 13 = **80.8%** (A+ grade; below 82.0% AA- floor)

**Bond grade thresholds:**
- AA or above: composite >= 85.0%
- AA- : composite >= 82.0%
- A+ : composite >= 78.0%
- A : composite >= 74.0%
- Below A: composite < 74.0% (requires investor disclosure)

**When the composite drops below 82.0%, add a visible alert panel to the bond page.**
